      "message": "[warning] Line 1443: 🟡 Emitting a message notification during structure repair can surface old messages as new/unread work to clients at startup. If the goal is only to make the restored conversation visible, prefer the existing conversation-created/updated notification path or explicitly mark this as a sync/repair notification so clients do not treat the last commit as a newly received message.",
      "revId": "addb3d3fa24c144d398f7d8ff8360fc2739a9960",
